msgid "Left and Right step one frame, Up and Down jump to edit points, Shift+V selects the clip at the playhead, Ctrl+A all clips and Escape none. Ctrl+Left and Ctrl+Right move the selected clips a frame (with Shift a second), Ctrl+Up and Ctrl+Down to the track above or below; braces trim the clip's start or end to the playhead. Shift+F10 opens the clip menu (in a track header, the track menu), Delete removes the selected clips."
